      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-01-2024-june/q1",
      "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(z)=z^4-6z^3+az^2+bz+145\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span> are real constants.</p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2+5\\mathrm i\"></span> is a root of the equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(z)=0\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>determine the other roots of the equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(z)=0\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(7)</span></li><li>Show all the roots of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(z)=0\"></span> on a single Argand diagram. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
