      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-01-2024-june/q2",
      "question": "<p>The roots of the equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2x^3-3x^2+12x+7=0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\beta\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\gamma\"></span></p><p>Without solving the equation,</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>write down the value of each of<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\alpha+\\beta+\\gamma\\qquad\\alpha\\beta+\\alpha\\gamma+\\beta\\gamma\\qquad\\alpha\\beta\\gamma\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li><li>Use the answers to part (a) to determine the value of<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{2}{\\alpha}+\\dfrac{2}{\\beta}+\\dfrac{2}{\\gamma}\"></span></li><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\alpha-1)(\\beta-1)(\\gamma-1)\"></span></li><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha^2+\\beta^2+\\gamma^2\"></span></li></ol><span class=\"marks\">(7)</span></li></ol>",
